2026-09-24T00:30:48.8716168Z   mirror: |
2026-09-24T00:30:48.8716507Z     SSTATE_MIRRORS = "file://.* http://sstate.yoctoproject.org/all/PATH;downloadfilename=PATH"
2026-09-24T00:30:48.8716840Z   ccache: |
